  "prompt": "For each Voltmarkt store type (stores.store_type), how many orders were placed from 1 January to 31 March 2025 (the UTC days of order_ts), and how many units did an order hold on average? Count only the orders that have at least one order line: an order with no lines is left out of both columns, not counted as an order with 0 units. Return exactly three columns, in this order: store_type, orders and avg_units_per_order (the units divided by the orders, not rounded). Return one row for each store type with orders. Any row order is fine.",
